  "id": "chicken-spinach-and-bacon-alfredo-pasta-bake",
  "name": "Chicken, Spinach and Bacon Alfredo Pasta Bake",
  "subtitle": "Creamy chicken pasta with spinach, bacon, and a crisp crumb topping",
  "description": "A hearty baked pasta combining tender chicken, creamy Parmesan sauce, spinach, tomatoes, and bacon beneath a toasted breadcrumb topping.",
